  // ---------- insight ----------
  "Khusus internal, bukan untuk dibagikan ke nasabah. Halaman ini merangkum tiga hal: produk kita yang perlu dicek, produk yang sedang banyak dibeli investor, dan reksa dana bagus di pasar yang belum ada di daftar kita.": "Internal only, not to be shared with clients. This page summarizes three things: our products that need checking, products investors are buying heavily, and good funds in the market that are not on our list yet.",
  "Cara memakai halaman ini": "How to use this page", "Perlu perhatian": "Needs attention",
  ": cek tiap awal pekan. Isinya produk kita yang datanya bermasalah, harganya sedang turun cukup dalam, atau rating bintangnya berubah. Tiap baris punya saran tindak lanjut.": ": check at the start of each week. It lists our products with data problems, prices that have fallen sharply, or changed star ratings. Each row has a suggested follow-up.",
  "Lagi diminati": "In demand",
  ": pakai saat menentukan produk yang dipromosikan bulan ini. Produk yang banyak dibeli investor lain lebih mudah ditawarkan.": ": use it when choosing products to promote this month. Products that other investors buy a lot are easier to offer.",
  ": bahan rapat dengan manajer investasi atau tim produk saat menambah daftar produk.": ": material for meetings with investment managers or the product team when adding products.",
  "Semua angka berasal dari data historis harian dan bulanan. Angka diperbarui otomatis tiap hari bursa; dana kelolaan diperbarui bulanan oleh manajer investasi.": "All figures come from daily and monthly historical data. Figures update automatically every exchange day; AUM is updated monthly by investment managers.",
  "Ringkasan mingguan": "Weekly summary", "Salin ringkasan": "Copy summary",
  "Terkirim otomatis ke kanal tim tiap Senin pagi. Isinya bisa juga disalin ke email.": "Sent automatically to the team channel every Monday morning. The content can also be copied into an email.",
  "Belum terhubung ke kanal tim. Salin dan tempel ke email atau grup, atau minta admin mengisi NOTIFY_WEBHOOK di Cloudflare supaya terkirim otomatis tiap Senin pagi.": "Not connected to a team channel yet. Copy and paste it into an email or group, or ask an admin to set NOTIFY_WEBHOOK in Cloudflare so it is sent automatically every Monday morning.",
  "Ringkasan belum bisa dimuat.": "The summary could not be loaded.",
  "Merah: data bermasalah": "Red: data problem",
  "Produk belum punya data NAB, atau NAB-nya berhenti diperbarui lebih dari 4 hari sementara produk lain sudah. Bisa berarti produk dihentikan sementara, sedang likuidasi, atau ada masalah di sumber data.": "The product has no NAV data yet, or its NAV stopped updating for more than 4 days while other products did. It may be suspended, in liquidation, or there may be a problem at the data source.",
  "Kuning: perlu dicek": "Yellow: needs checking",
  "NAB sekarang lebih dari 5% di bawah titik tertingginya dalam 1 tahun terakhir (dari data mingguan), atau rating bintang 1 tahun turun dibanding sebulan lalu. Nasabah yang memegang produk ini mungkin bertanya.": "The NAV is now more than 5% below its highest point in the last year (from weekly data), or the 1-year star rating fell versus a month ago. Clients holding this product may ask.",
  "Hijau: kabar baik": "Green: good news",
  "Rating bintang 1 tahun naik dibanding sebulan lalu. Kandidat untuk dipromosikan atau dimasukkan ke Pilihan.": "The 1-year star rating rose versus a month ago. A candidate for promotion or for Picks.",
  "Apa yang diukur": "What is measured", "jumlah unit": "number of units",
  "reksa dana yang beredar, bukan perubahan dana kelolaan. Unit hanya bertambah kalau ada investor yang membeli, dan berkurang kalau ada yang mencairkan. Kenaikan harga tidak ikut terhitung.": "outstanding, not the change in AUM. Units only increase when investors buy, and decrease when they redeem. Price gains are not counted.",
  "Perubahan": "The change in", "Cara menghitung": "How it is calculated",
  "Unit = dana kelolaan akhir bulan ÷ NAB akhir bulan. Contoh: dana kelolaan naik 10% dan NAB naik 8%, maka unit naik sekitar 1,9%. Artinya hanya sekitar 1,9% yang benar-benar uang baru, sisanya kenaikan harga.": "Units = month-end AUM ÷ month-end NAV. Example: AUM up 10% and NAV up 8% means units rose about 1.9%. So only about 1.9% is genuinely new money; the rest is price gain.",
  "Cara memakai": "How to use it",
  "Arus 1 bulan menunjukkan minat terbaru; arus 3 bulan menunjukkan minat yang bertahan. Paling meyakinkan kalau keduanya positif. Dana keluar besar perlu dicek: bisa karena kinerja turun, atau satu investor besar mencairkan.": "The 1-month flow shows the latest interest; the 3-month flow shows lasting interest. Most convincing when both are positive. Large outflows need checking: performance may have dropped, or a single large investor redeemed.",
  "Manajer investasi yang produknya ada di daftar kita: berapa produknya di daftar, seberapa besar mereka di seluruh pasar, dan rata-rata rating bintang produknya di daftar. Bahan negosiasi dan untuk memilih mitra yang produknya konsisten bagus.": "Investment managers with products on our list: how many of their products are listed, how big they are across the market, and the average star rating of their listed products. Material for negotiation and for choosing partners with consistently good products.",
  "Kriteria": "Criteria", "Reksa dana di pasar yang": "Funds in the market that are", "belum ada di daftar kita": "not on our list yet",
  ", dengan rating bintang 4 atau 5 untuk periode 1 tahun, dan dana kelolaan minimal Rp 10 miliar. Diurutkan dari skor rating tertinggi.": ", with a 4- or 5-star 1-year rating, and AUM of at least Rp 10 billion. Sorted by highest rating score.",
  "Artinya bintang 4–5": "What 4–5 stars means",
  "Masuk 32,5% teratas di jenisnya, dihitung dari 40% modified Sharpe (return dibanding risiko), 40% total return, dan 20% pertumbuhan unit. Jadi bukan sekadar return tinggi, tapi juga stabil dan diminati investor.": "In the top 32.5% of its type, scored from 40% modified Sharpe (return versus risk), 40% total return, and 20% unit growth. So not just a high return, but also stable and in demand by investors.",
  "Bahan diskusi saat menambah produk: cek apakah manajer investasinya sudah bekerja sama dengan kita sebagai agen penjual, lalu bandingkan dengan produk sejenis yang sudah ada di daftar. Rating 1 tahun bisa berubah; lihat juga kinerja 3 tahun sebelum memutuskan.": "Discussion material when adding products: check whether the investment manager already works with us as a selling agent, then compare with similar products already on the list. The 1-year rating can change; also look at 3-year performance before deciding.",
  "{n} perlu dicek": "{n} need checking", "{n} perlu dicek, {m} kabar baik": "{n} need checking, {m} good news",
